00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.750
10 minutes before 
swimsuit takeoff

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:24.290
Base, here we come!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.950
So this explains the swimsuits!

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:31.990
I wanna be stepped on!

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:35.370
Glug glu...

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:36.450
Gu...

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:49.950
This is...?

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.790
The base's pool?

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:53.490
Over here!

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:57.950
Is that it?

00:18:57.950 --> 00:19:00.490
All right. Don't anyone make a sound.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.200
Huh? Uh... A...

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:03.490
No! Idiot!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:04.700
Mng! Mm!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.490
Achoo!

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:14.990
I'm sorry!

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:17.240
Hurry up!

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.950
Sono! Hurry! Hurry!

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:27.450
But my body's not--

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:28.360
Behind you!

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.700
Backup?! Who's that?!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:42.830
Just get your ass to the hanger!

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:43.950
Right!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:47.040
Flight prep?!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:51.040
Crew did it before they conked out!
Don't go crashing on me!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.080
Duh!

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:53.580
Am I good to fly?

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:57.200
Darn tootin'! Go get 'em, tardy girls!

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:58.700
You've got it!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.870
Ugh!

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:08.490
909th Valkyrie Wing! All planes, take off!

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:24.660
Front wedgie! Front wedgie! Front wedgie!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.740
Stop! Now I'm picturing it!

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:29.120
Azu, you pervert!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.580
Huh?!

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:34.080
I can't be a bride anymore!

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:38.950
We're in the air. Now commencing the plan.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:39.740
--Claudy!
--Miko!
--Sonoka!

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:43.490
Tigercat. Sorry, but can
you take out the small fry?

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:45.700
Sure thing.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.700
How's the wave analysis?

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:51.790
Analysis complete.
Interference signal is ready to go.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:55.370
Perfect! Miyako, you know the plan?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:58.660
All we've gotta do is take down one each!

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:02.040
Right. But timing is everything.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:26.660
Yet again, Azu's plan is a huge success!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.740
Thanks, everyone!

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.240
Cheese!

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:33.240
Whew! All that falling paid off!

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.120
That's Azu for you! Our favorite!

00:21:36.120 --> 00:21:38.540
Uh... Sure, whatever.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:43.660
Good work, everyone.
It was another rough one today.

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:47.990
We were saved by everyone's bravery.

00:21:47.990 --> 00:21:51.290
By the way, Commander... What was that plane?

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:54.910
Oh, that? If you wanna know,

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:57.330
might as well ask in person.

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:12.540
Hey, guys!

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.330
Those are some outfits you fly in!

00:23:57.620 --> 00:23:59.740
The dream of men--the sea!

00:23:59.740 --> 00:24:01.910
Memories of summer--the sea!

00:24:01.910 --> 00:24:04.450
Splashing water at girls--the sea!

00:24:04.450 --> 00:24:06.620
Clappity clap! The sea!

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:07.290
Good sea!

00:24:07.290 --> 00:24:08.080
Nice sea!

00:24:08.080 --> 00:24:09.040
Our sea!

00:24:09.040 --> 00:24:10.700
It's man's true desire!

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:12.040
Next Time

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:12.040
Episode 5
Tateyama Joint Forces!

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:12.040
Cheese!
